Small fixes. Lost gaze (0018): while the focus eases to the fixed one, its size eases too, from the tracked section
(with its widening) to the fixed section (Quad Views' fixed and foveated sizes differ, 0.5 and 0.35 by default): the
hand-over to the fixed focus at the end of the ease was a step in size. Opaque focus (0024, dcsvr_two_layers_alpha 3)
when it cannot compose (no periphery source): the focus pass is mode 0's, as its flags are, instead of falling into
mode 2's encoding for an sRGB swapchain on a UNORM one.

